  BaseScale: 178.53
  Width: 4.58
  Height: 2.25
  TitleText: ABOUT
  TitleFontSize: 2.74
  TitleOffset: 0.1
  BodyText: 'Timeflow is a powerful and flexible animation system for Unity offering
    a new range of creative possibilities for artists and developers. With a focus
    on motion graphics and music synchronization, Timeflow offers a robust integrated
    track and channel based timeline with advanced curve editing tools, procedural
    animations, dynamic behaviors, and much more. This app demonstrates some of the
    key features of Timeflow for both choreographed and interactive contexts.


    <align="center">For
    more information visit: axongenesis.com/timeflow</align>'
  BodyFontSize: 2.48
  BodyOffset: -0.42
